ntrols name this explicitly", :adr/fresh-governor-no-collision-2660 "this blueprint's own :itonami.blueprint/governor keyword, :medical-device-governor, is grep-verified UNIQUE fleet-wide", :adr/west-registration-deliberately-not-done-2660 "same established precedent as every prior fresh-blueprint build this scope: none of the cloud-itonami-isic-* repos are registered as west projects. cloud-itonami-isic-2660 follows suit -- no :extra-projects/west.yml entry", :adr/fourth-spec-authoring-build "FOURTH 'author a new blueprint from :spec tier' build, and the FIRST to pick a manufacturing-sector vertical rather than a services/dispatch-shaped one. Every prior fresh-blueprint pick this scope (securityops/8010, foodserviceops/5610, investigationops/8030) followed the SAME intake->dispatch/report->audit operating-states shape; '2660' instead follows a manufacturing lifecycle: [:spec :design :produce :inspect :package :audit]", :adr/blueprint-only-artifacts-2660 "published README.md, blueprint.edn, docs/business-model.md, docs/operator-guide.md, CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md, CONTRIBUTING.md, GOVERNANCE.md, SECURITY.md, LICENSE (AGPL-3.0-or-later, verbatim) -- SAME artifact set as every prior fresh-blueprint publication this scope. Deliberately NO src/test/deps.edn/docs/adr/0001-architecture.md", :adr/title "cloud-itonami-isic-2660 (community medical device manufacturing) published as a fresh :blueprint", :adr/registry-field-replacement-2660 "the existing '2660' registry entry had its :repo, :business-id and :optional-technologies fields updated, and its explicit :maturity :spec override REMOVED so maturity/maturity-of now auto-derive :blueprint from the real :repo presence"}]